  <div class="fold">
   <h4>Concrete creep and shrinkage</h4>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 B.1(1)]</p>
   <p>
    <b>Creep</b>
   </p>
   <p>
    Relative humidity of the environment, %
    <span class="eq">
     <var>RH</var>
     = 60
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Perimeter of cross section in contact with the atmosphere</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>u</var>
     = 2 ·  (
     <var>b</var>
     +
     <var>h</var>
     )  = 2 ·  ( 250
     <i>mm</i>
     + 550
     <i>mm</i>
     )  = 1600
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>
    Cross section area -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>c</sub>
     =
     <var>b</var>
     ·
     <var>h</var>
     = 250
     <i>mm</i>
     · 550
     <i>mm</i>
     = 137500
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Notional size of the cross section</p>
   <p class="ref">(eq. B.6)</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>h</var>
     <sub>0</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      2 ·
      <var>A</var>
      <sub>c</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>u</var>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      2 · 137500
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">2</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1600
      <i>mm</i>
     </span>
     = 171.88
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Relative humidity factor</p>
   <p class="ref">(eq. B.3a)</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>φ</var>
     <sub>RH</sub>
     = 1 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1 −
      <span class="dvc">
       <var>RH</var>
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       100
      </span>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      0.1 ·
      <span class="b1">(</span>
      <span class="dvc">
       <var>h</var>
       <sub>0</sub>
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       1
       <i>mm</i>
      </span>
      <span class="b1">)</span>
      <sup class="raised">0.333</sup>
     </span>
     = 1 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1 −
      <span class="dvc">
       60
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       100
      </span>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      0.1 ·
      <span class="b1">(</span>
      <span class="dvc">
       171.88
       <i>mm</i>
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       1
       <i>mm</i>
      </span>
      <span class="b1">)</span>
      <sup class="raised">0.333</sup>
     </span>
     = 1.72
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Concrete strength factor</p>
   <p class="ref">(eq. B.4)</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>β</var>
     <sub>f_cm</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc down">
      16.8
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <span class="o1">
       <span class="r1">
       </span>
       <span class="dvc">
        <var>f</var>
        <sub>cm</sub>
        <span class="dvl">
        </span>
        1
        <i>MPa</i>
       </span>
      </span>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc down">
