      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <span class="o1">
       <span class="r1">
       </span>
       <span class="dvc">
        33
        <i>MPa</i>
        <span class="dvl">
        </span>
        1
        <i>MPa</i>
       </span>
      </span>
     </span>
     = 2.92
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>
    Concrete age at the moment of loading -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>t</var>
     <sub>0</sub>
     = 28
     <i>d</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Concrete age factor</p>
   <p class="ref">(eq. B.5)</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>β</var>
     <sub>t0</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc down">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
