   </p>
   <p>Effective ratio of modules of elasticity</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(6)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>α</var>
     <sub>e</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
