      <sub>s</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>E</var>
      <sub>c_eff</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      200
      <i>GPa</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      9.1
      <i>GPa</i>
     </span>
     = 21.97
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 B.2(1)]</p>
   <p>
    <b>Shrinkage</b>
   </p>
   <p>Coefficient depending on the notional size</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     <sub>h</sub>
     = 1 −
     <span class="dvc">
