    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Basic drying shrinkage strain</p>
   <p class="ref">(eq. B.11)</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>ε</var>
     <sub>cd0</sub>
     = 0.85 ·  ( 220 + 110 ·
