     <i>mm</i>
     − 45
     <i>mm</i>
     )  − 100.53
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     ·  ( 550
     <i>mm</i>
     − 394.28
     <i>mm</i>
     − 45
     <i>mm</i>
     )  = 427791
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">3</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature due to shrinkage of uncracked section</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(6)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_I</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>ε</var>
      <sub>cs</sub>
      ·
