     <sub>cs_I</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      157
      <i>kNm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      9.1
      <i>GPa</i>
      · 11521310457
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     + 3.65×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     = 1.86×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>First moment of reinforcement area about centroid of cracked section</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>S</var>
     =
     <var>A</var>
     <sub>s1</sub>
