     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">2</sup>
     ·  ( 96.46
     <i>mm</i>
     − 45
     <i>mm</i>
     )  = 508208
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">3</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature due to shrinkage of cracked section</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(6)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_II</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>ε</var>
      <sub>cs</sub>
      ·
      <var>α</var>
      <sub>e</sub>
      ·
      <var>S</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red_II</sub>
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      0.000447 · 21.97 · 508208
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">3</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      5332235820
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     = 9.36×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Curvature of cracked section</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>II</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>M</var>
      <sub>qp</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>E</var>
      <sub>c_eff</sub>
      ·
      <var>I</var>
      <sub>red_II</sub>
     </span>
     +
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>cs_II</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      157
      <i>kNm</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      9.1
      <i>GPa</i>
      · 5332235820
      <i>mm</i>
      <sup class="unit">4</sup>
     </span>
     + 9.36×10
     <sup>-7</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     = 4.17×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Total curvature</p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.3(3)]</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>θ</var>
     =
     <var>ζ</var>
     ·
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>II</sub>
     +  ( 1 −
     <var>ζ</var>
     )  ·
     <var>θ</var>
     <sub>I</sub>
     = 0.886 · 4.17×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     +  ( 1 − 0.886 )  · 1.86×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     = 3.91×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p>Factor considering the static scheme</p>
   <p>
    <span class="eq">
     <var>k</var>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      48
     </span>
     = 0.104
    </span>
    - for simply supported beam with uniformly distributed load
   </p>
   <p>
    Deflection due to quasi-permanent combination -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>δ</var>
     =
     <var>k</var>
     ·
     <var>θ</var>
     ·
     <var>L</var>
     <sup>2</sup>
     = 0.104 · 3.91×10
     <sup>-6</sup>
     <i>mm</i>
     <sup class="unit">-1</sup>
     ·  ( 5.75
     <i>m</i>
     )
     <sup>2</sup>
     = 13.46
     <i>mm</i>
    </span>
   </p>
   <p class="ref">[EN 1992-1-1 §7.4.1(4)]</p>
   <p>
    Maximum deflection -
    <span class="eq">
     <var>δ</var>
     <sub>max</sub>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>L</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      250
     </span>
     =
     <span class="dvc">
      5.75
      <i>m</i>
